# flame-navdoom: the champion one knob apart -- navtilt 3, the learned driver.
# The doom model (cross-tree AUC 0.755, precision 0.69) arms the naval
# clause once at its sample-2000 window; the panel asks whether a
# 0.69-precision oracle clears the bar three scalar gates missed

